      "period": "modern",
      "gloss": "a diskette, a floppy disk",
      "evidence": [
        "Traupman 260, 305, 316"
      ],
      "comment": "A diminutive of <span lang=\"la\">discus</span>; Lewis &amp; Short has no such word."
